<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>ECAP<sp/>Capture<sp/>PWM{#EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_ECAP_EX2_CAPTURE_PWM}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>examples<sp/>uses<sp/>ECAP<sp/>to<sp/>capture<sp/>the<sp/>EPWM<sp/>(MCPWM<sp/>in<sp/>case<sp/>of<sp/>F28E12x<sp/>and<sp/>MCPC029)<sp/>signal.<sp/>ECAP<sp/>can<sp/>be<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>calculate<sp/>time<sp/>period,<sp/>frequency<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>required<sp/>signal.<sp/>Here,<sp/>ECAP<sp/>is<sp/>configured<sp/>to<sp/>capture<sp/>time<sp/>between<sp/>rising<sp/>and<sp/>falling<sp/>edge<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>EPWM.<sp/>(MCPWM<sp/>in<sp/>case<sp/>of<sp/>F28E12x<sp/>and<sp/>MCPC029)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>example<sp/>does<sp/>the<sp/>below</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>configures<sp/>ePWM3A<sp/>for:<sp/>(MCPWM1A<sp/>in<sp/>case<sp/>of<sp/>F28E12x<sp/>and<sp/>MCPC029)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Up<sp/>count<sp/>mode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Period<sp/>starts<sp/>at<sp/>500<sp/>and<sp/>goes<sp/>up<sp/>to<sp/>8000</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Toggle<sp/>output<sp/>on<sp/>PRD</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Watch<sp/><sp/>Variables</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>ecap1PassCount<sp/>-<sp/>Successful<sp/>ECAP<sp/>captures.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>ecap1IntCount<sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Number<sp/>of<sp/>Interrupt<sp/>counts.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>External<sp/>Connections</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x<sp/>||<sp/>F28P55x<sp/><sp/>||<sp/>F28P551x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>eCAP1<sp/>is<sp/>on<sp/>GPIO16</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>ePWM3A<sp/>is<sp/>on<sp/>GPIO4</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>GPIO4<sp/>to<sp/>GPIO16.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F28E12x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>eCAP1<sp/>is<sp/>on<sp/>GPIO2</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>MCPWM1A<sp/>is<sp/>on<sp/>GPIO0</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Connect<sp/>GPIO0<sp/>to<sp/>GPIO2.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Steps<sp/>to<sp/>Run<sp/>the<sp/>Example</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**When<sp/>using<sp/>CCS<sp/>projects<sp/>to<sp/>build**,<sp/>import<sp/>the<sp/>CCS<sp/>project<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>required<sp/>combination</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>and<sp/>build<sp/>it<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>CCS<sp/>project<sp/>menu<sp/>(see<sp/>\ref<sp/>CCS_PROJECTS_PAGE).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**When<sp/>using<sp/>makefiles<sp/>to<sp/>build**,<sp/>note<sp/>the<sp/>required<sp/>combination<sp/>and<sp/>build<sp/>using</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>make<sp/>command<sp/>(see<sp/>\ref<sp/>MAKEFILE_BUILD_PAGE)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Establish<sp/>connections<sp/>as<sp/>mentioned<sp/>in<sp/>External<sp/>Connections<sp/>section.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Launch<sp/>a<sp/>CCS<sp/>debug<sp/>session<sp/>and<sp/>run<sp/>the<sp/>executable,<sp/>see<sp/>\ref<sp/>CCS_LAUNCH_PAGE</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Using<sp/>the<sp/>watch<sp/>variables,<sp/>view<sp/>the<sp/>number<sp/>the<sp/>number<sp/>of<sp/>captures<sp/>and<sp/>interrupt<sp/>counts.</highlight></codeline>
